WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:04.155
&gt;&gt; Chris: DAVID SPUNT

00:00:04.156 --> 00:00:06.015
REPORTING FROM THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:06.994
DAVID, THANK YOU.

00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:09.240
JOIN US NOW, FORMER CDC DIRECTOR

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:10.026
DR. TOM FRIEDEN.

00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:11.403
DOCTOR, I WANT TO START WITH THE

00:00:11.404 --> 00:00:12.697
SPREAD OF THE VIRUS THESE PAST

00:00:12.698 --> 00:00:14.772
FEW WEEKS.

00:00:14.773 --> 00:00:17.992
THERE WAS ON FRIDAY MORE THAN

00:00:18.026 --> 00:00:22.320
45,000 NEW CASES, A NEW SINGLE

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:24.053
DAY HIGH FOR OUR COUNTRY.

00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:26.162
13 STATES SET RECORD HIGHS FOR

00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:31.013
THE SEVEN DAY AVERAGE, NEW

00:00:31.014 --> 00:00:31.351
CASES.

00:00:31.353 --> 00:00:32.394
BUT VICE PRESIDENT PENCE SAID

00:00:32.396 --> 00:00:33.021
THIS.

00:00:33.023 --> 00:00:35.086
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE BEEN MADE TRULY

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.709
REMARKABLE PROGRESS.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.529
IN MOVING OUR NATION FORWARD.

00:00:38.531 --> 00:00:40.831
WE’VE ALL SEEN THE ENCOURAGING

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:43.332
NEWS AS WE OPEN UP AMERICA AGAIN

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:43.564
AGAIN.

00:00:43.598 --> 00:00:45.961
&gt;&gt; Chris: DOCTOR, ARE WE

00:00:45.995 --> 00:00:47.255
MAKING TRULY REMARKABLE

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:48.562
PROGRESS, AND IS THAT THE RIGHT

00:00:48.563 --> 00:00:51.396
MESSAGE TO BE SENDING TO THE

00:00:51.431 --> 00:00:52.416
NATION AT THIS MOMENT?

00:00:52.417 --> 00:00:53.575
&gt;&gt; Dr. Frieden: WELL, THERE’S

00:00:53.576 --> 00:00:54.536
NO DOUBT WE’RE DOING MORE

00:00:54.571 --> 00:00:55.739
TESTING, OUR HOSPITALS ARE

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.067
BETTER PREPARED, BUT THERE’S

00:00:57.102 --> 00:00:59.559
ALSO NO DOUBT THAT THE VIRUS HAS

00:00:59.594 --> 00:01:00.224
THE UPPER HAND.

00:01:00.225 --> 00:01:01.802
THIS VIRUS IS NOT GOING TO GO

00:01:01.837 --> 00:01:03.317
AWAY ON ITS OWN.

00:01:03.351 --> 00:01:05.762
WE HAVE TO STOP IT AND ONLY WE

00:01:05.763 --> 00:01:06.890
CAN DO THAT BY WORKING TOGETHER.

00:01:06.924 --> 00:01:09.793
WE ARE ALL SICK AND TIRED OF

00:01:09.828 --> 00:01:11.814
STAYING HOME, BUT YOU KNOW WHAT,

00:01:11.815 --> 00:01:14.322
THE VIRUS IS NOT TIRED OF MAKING

00:01:14.323 --> 00:01:15.894
US SICK AND WHAT WE ARE SEEING,

00:01:15.895 --> 00:01:17.524
PARTICULARLY IN SOUTHERN STATES,

00:01:17.558 --> 00:01:19.150
BUT IN MOST PARTS OF THE U.S.,

00:01:19.184 --> 00:01:22.137
IS THIS VIRUS INCREASING AND IN

00:01:22.171 --> 00:01:23.406
SOME STATES INCREASING

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:23.709
EXPLOSIVELY.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:26.751
&gt;&gt; Chris: LET ME DRILL DOWN ON

00:01:26.785 --> 00:01:28.892
THAT, HOW DO YOU EXPLAIN THE NEW

00:01:28.926 --> 00:01:31.831
SURGEON CASES, ESPECIALLY IN THE

00:01:31.865 --> 00:01:33.711
SOUTH AND THE WEST IMPACTED SOME

00:01:33.712 --> 00:01:35.840
STATES IN THOSE REGIONS, DID

00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.611
THEY OPEN UP TOO SOON, WE OPEN

00:01:38.645 --> 00:01:40.238
TOO SOON AND WITHOUT ENOUGH

00:01:40.239 --> 00:01:40.534
RESTRICTIONS?

00:01:40.568 --> 00:01:43.237
&gt;&gt; Dr. Frieden: AS I SAID TO

00:01:43.238 --> 00:01:44.748
YOU SIX WEEKS AGO TODAY, THIS IS

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.111
GOING TO BACKFIRE.

00:01:46.146 --> 00:01:48.216
IF WE ARE MOVING TOO FAST.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.161
IF YOU OPEN WHEN CASES ARE STILL

00:01:51.195 --> 00:01:52.653
INCREASING, AS MANY STATES DID,

00:01:52.687 --> 00:01:54.282
IT’S LIKE LEANING INTO A LEFT

00:01:54.283 --> 00:01:54.490
HOOK.

00:01:54.491 --> 00:01:56.453
THEY’RE GOING TO GET HIT HARD

00:01:56.487 --> 00:01:58.197
AND THAT’S WHAT’S HAPPENING.

00:01:58.231 --> 00:02:00.653
WHEN WE SEE ARIZONA, TEXAS,

00:02:00.654 --> 00:02:02.522
FLORIDA, SOUTH CAROLINA, THEY

00:02:02.524 --> 00:02:04.204
ARE CURRENTLY IN A RAPID UPSWING

00:02:04.206 --> 00:02:07.180
AND SAD TO SAY, THIS IS GOING TO

00:02:07.181 --> 00:02:08.559
CONTINUE TO GET WORSE FOR WEEKS.

00:02:08.593 --> 00:02:10.830
BECAUSE THE PHYSICAL DISTANCING

00:02:10.865 --> 00:02:11.913
THAT THEY’RE IMPLEMENTING NOW

00:02:11.914 --> 00:02:13.261
WILL ONLY TAKE EFFECT -- YOU

00:02:13.262 --> 00:02:14.606
WON’T SEE IT FOR ANOTHER FEW

00:02:14.607 --> 00:02:16.520
WEEKS, SO WE ARE GOING TO SEE A

00:02:16.521 --> 00:02:18.996
FEW MORE WEEKS OF INCREASES IN

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.249
ALL LIKELIHOOD IN SEVERAL STATES

00:02:20.283 --> 00:02:20.473
STATES.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.499
THERE’S SOME COMFORT IN THE FACT

00:02:22.501 --> 00:02:23.549
THAT IT’S YOUNGER PEOPLE, BUT

00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:26.031
WHAT STARTS IN THE YOUNG DOESN’T

00:02:26.032 --> 00:02:27.043
STAY IN THE YOUNG.

00:02:27.044 --> 00:02:28.805
YOUNGER PEOPLE HAVE PARENTS,

00:02:28.839 --> 00:02:31.763
UNCLES, NEPHEWS, THEY GO OUT TO

00:02:31.797 --> 00:02:34.714
PLACES TO BUY FOOD AND WE ARE

00:02:34.716 --> 00:02:36.740
GOING TO SEE INCREASING SPREAD.

00:02:36.742 --> 00:02:38.794
THAT’S WHY THE THREE Ws ARE SO

00:02:38.795 --> 00:02:40.253
IMPORTANT, WEAR A MASK, WASH

00:02:40.254 --> 00:02:43.142
YOUR HANDS OR YOU SANITIZER, AND

00:02:43.144 --> 00:02:44.064
WATCH HER DISTANCE.

00:02:44.066 --> 00:02:44.991
THERE SOMETHING EVERYONE CAN DO.

00:02:45.025 --> 00:02:46.242
WE ARE REALLY ALL IN THIS

00:02:46.243 --> 00:02:47.905
TOGETHER AND IF WE WORK TOGETHER

00:02:47.939 --> 00:02:49.717
WE CAN HELP CONTROL THE VIRUS

00:02:49.751 --> 00:02:51.087
AND GET OUR ECONOMY BACK.

00:02:51.089 --> 00:02:51.922
PUBLIC HEALTH AND HEALTH ISSUES

00:02:51.957 --> 00:02:53.766
ARE NOT GETTING IN THE WAY OF

00:02:53.767 --> 00:02:56.729
OUR RECOVERY, THEY ARE THE ROUTE

00:02:56.764 --> 00:02:57.722
TO OUR RECOVERY.

00:02:57.755 --> 00:03:00.151
&gt;&gt; Chris: DOCTOR, ONE OF THE

00:03:00.152 --> 00:03:02.804
ARGUMENTS YOU HEAR IS THAT THE

00:03:02.805 --> 00:03:04.322
REASON WE ARE SEEING A SURGE IN

00:03:04.356 --> 00:03:07.301
NEW CASES IS BECAUSE WE ARE

00:03:07.302 --> 00:03:09.812
SEEING A SURGE IN MORE TESTING.

00:03:09.847 --> 00:03:12.024
HERE’S PRESIDENT TRUMP ON THAT

00:03:12.026 --> 00:03:12.959
THIS WEEK.

00:03:12.961 --> 00:03:14.751
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE MORE CASES BECAUSE WE

00:03:14.752 --> 00:03:16.430
DO THE GREATEST TESTING.

00:03:16.431 --> 00:03:19.205
IF WE DIDN’T DO TESTING, WE HAVE

00:03:19.206 --> 00:03:19.896
NO CASES.

00:03:19.931 --> 00:03:21.046
&gt;&gt; Chris: IS THE SEARCH

00:03:21.081 --> 00:03:23.117
FUNCTION OF MORE TESTING, OR IS

00:03:23.118 --> 00:03:25.591
IT A REFLECTION OF THE FACT THAT

00:03:25.592 --> 00:03:27.916
THE VIRUS IS ACTUALLY SPREADING?

00:03:27.917 --> 00:03:29.479
&gt;&gt; Dr. Frieden: AS A DOCTOR,

00:03:29.514 --> 00:03:31.251
SCIENTIST, AN EPIDEMIOLOGIST, I

00:03:31.286 --> 00:03:32.883
CAN TELL YOU WITH 100% CERTAINTY

00:03:32.884 --> 00:03:34.610
THAT IN MOST STATES WHERE YOU’RE

00:03:34.611 --> 00:03:35.892
SEEING AN INCREASE, IT IS A REAL

00:03:35.893 --> 00:03:36.091
INCREASE.

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:38.431
IT IS NOT MORE TESTS, IT IS MORE

00:03:38.465 --> 00:03:39.811
SPREAD OF THE VIRUS AND THE ONE

00:03:39.812 --> 00:03:41.914
NUMBER TO LOOK AT THAT’S VERY

00:03:41.916 --> 00:03:43.279
IMPORTANT IS THE PERCENT OF

00:03:43.281 --> 00:03:44.247
TESTS THAT ARE POSITIVE.

00:03:44.248 --> 00:03:46.264
IF THE NUMBER OF CASES, THAT CAN

00:03:46.265 --> 00:03:48.782
VARY SOME BECAUSE WE ARE ONLY

00:03:48.783 --> 00:03:50.070
DIAGNOSING TEN, 20% OF ALL

00:03:50.071 --> 00:03:50.285
CASES.

00:03:50.286 --> 00:03:52.029
SO THE NUMBERS YOU’RE SEEING ARE

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:54.081
JUST A REFLECTION, TIP OF THE

00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:55.708
ICEBERG OF EVEN MORE SPREAD.

00:03:55.743 --> 00:03:57.016
BUT WHERE THE NUMBERS ARE

00:03:57.017 --> 00:03:58.327
INCREASING, YOU COULD ARIZONA

00:03:58.362 --> 00:03:59.724
WITH NEARLY 1 OUT OF 4 TESTS

00:03:59.725 --> 00:04:01.382
POSITIVE AND AT THE SAME TIME

00:04:01.383 --> 00:04:04.670
YOU ARE INCREASING THE NUMBER OF

00:04:04.671 --> 00:04:06.493
TESTS, I CAN TELL YOU WITH

00:04:06.494 --> 00:04:08.688
ABSOLUTE CERTAINTY THAT’S

00:04:08.689 --> 00:04:10.287
EXPLOSIVE SPREAD OF CORONAVIRUS.

00:04:10.289 --> 00:04:14.446
&gt;&gt; Chris: WHILE WE ARE SEEING

00:04:14.447 --> 00:04:16.518
THE NUMBER OF CASES EXPLODE, UP

00:04:16.519 --> 00:04:19.185
65% IN THE LAST TWO WEEKS, WE

00:04:19.187 --> 00:04:21.381
ARE SEEING THE NUMBER OF DEATHS

00:04:21.383 --> 00:04:23.319
ACTUALLY DROPPING 27%.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.712
HOW DO YOU EXPLAIN THAT?

00:04:24.746 --> 00:04:25.929
&gt;&gt; Dr. Frieden: THERE ARE A

00:04:25.964 --> 00:04:27.319
FEW THINGS GOING ON.

00:04:27.321 --> 00:04:29.984
FIRST OFF, DEATHS WILL LAG CASES

00:04:29.986 --> 00:04:31.178
BY ABOUT A MONTH.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.729
IT TAKES SOME TIME FOR SOMEONE

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.605
TO FEEL SICK, GET HOSPITALIZED

00:04:34.639 --> 00:04:35.375
AND UNFORTUNATELY DIED.

00:04:35.409 --> 00:04:38.032
SECOND, THE CASES DO APPEAR TO

00:04:38.066 --> 00:04:40.311
BE IN YOUNGER PEOPLE KNOW IN THE

00:04:40.345 --> 00:04:41.897
DEATH RATE IS FAR, FAR FAR LOWER

00:04:41.898 --> 00:04:43.578
IN YOUNGER PEOPLE AND OLDER.

00:04:43.579 --> 00:04:44.831
BUT AS I SAID EARLIER, WHAT

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:46.635
STARTS IN YOUNG ADULTS, DOESN’T

00:04:46.636 --> 00:04:47.963
STAY IN YOUNG ADULTS.

00:04:47.964 --> 00:04:49.588
THERE MAY BE A LAG UNTIL WE SEE

00:04:49.623 --> 00:04:50.876
CASES.

00:04:50.878 --> 00:04:53.915
IT’S POSSIBLE THAT OLDER PEOPLE

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.120
ARE SHIELDING THEMSELVES MORE

00:04:55.121 --> 00:04:57.855
AND WE ARE ALSO GETTING BETTER

00:04:57.857 --> 00:04:59.094
FOR CARING FOR IT.

00:04:59.096 --> 00:05:01.412
THE EXPLOSIVE SPREAD IS BEING

00:05:01.414 --> 00:05:02.700
FOLLOWED YET BY AN EXPLOSIVE

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:04.823
INCREASE IN DEATHS, BUT WHAT WE

00:05:04.825 --> 00:05:06.002
ARE SEEING IN SOME STATES

00:05:06.003 --> 00:05:09.001
ALREADY IS A BIG INCREASE IN

00:05:09.036 --> 00:05:10.323
INTENSIVE CARE UNIT ADMISSIONS

00:05:10.358 --> 00:05:13.129
AND THAT’S A SIGN THAT THIS IS

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.595
NOT BENIGN, THIS IS GOING TO

00:05:14.596 --> 00:05:15.763
RESULT IN MORE DEATHS.

00:05:15.765 --> 00:05:17.180
WE ESTIMATE IN THE NEXT MONTH WE

00:05:17.181 --> 00:05:19.437
WILL SEE AT LEAST 15,000 MORE

00:05:19.438 --> 00:05:21.571
DEATHS IN THE U.S.

00:05:21.605 --> 00:05:23.669
&gt;&gt; Chris: MEANWHILE, THIS HAS

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.163
ALL BECOME EVEN MORE OF A

00:05:25.198 --> 00:05:26.816
POLITICAL ISSUE, AS EVERYTHING

00:05:26.817 --> 00:05:29.961
SEEMS TO BE IN THIS COUNTRY.

00:05:29.963 --> 00:05:32.386
76% OF DEMOCRATS SAY THAT THEY

00:05:32.387 --> 00:05:34.190
WEAR A MASK, ALL OR MOST OF THE

00:05:34.192 --> 00:05:34.838
TIME.

00:05:34.872 --> 00:05:38.463
AS COMPARED TO 53% OF

00:05:38.498 --> 00:05:41.436
REPUBLICANS AND THIS WEEK, 3,000

00:05:41.437 --> 00:05:43.104
YOUNG SUPPORTERS OF THE

00:05:43.105 --> 00:05:44.469
PRESIDENT PACKED A CHURCH IN

00:05:44.504 --> 00:05:46.579
ARIZONA AS YOU CAN SEE ON THE

00:05:46.614 --> 00:05:48.188
SCREEN HERE, ALMOST NONE OF THEM

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:49.971
WEARING MASKS.

00:05:49.973 --> 00:05:51.776
HERE’S VICE PRESIDENT PENCE.

00:05:51.778 --> 00:05:54.047
&gt;&gt; THE FREEDOM OF SPEECH ON THE

00:05:54.048 --> 00:05:55.117
RIGHT TO PEACEFULLY ASSEMBLE IS

00:05:55.151 --> 00:05:56.412
ENSHRINED WITH THE CONSTITUTION

00:05:56.413 --> 00:05:58.860
OF THE UNITED STATES.

00:05:58.895 --> 00:06:00.747
AND EVEN IN A HEALTH CRISIS,

00:06:00.748 --> 00:06:03.316
PEOPLE DON’T FORFEIT THEIR

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:03.910
CONSTITUTIONAL RIGHTS.

00:06:03.944 --> 00:06:06.023
&gt;&gt; Chris: I’M ASKING OF THIS

00:06:06.025 --> 00:06:08.708
IS THE FORMER HEAD OF THE CDC,

00:06:08.742 --> 00:06:10.032
ONE OF THE LEADING PUBLIC HEALTH

00:06:10.033 --> 00:06:11.371
EXPERTS IN THE COUNTRY.

00:06:11.372 --> 00:06:12.857
AS A MATTER OF PUBLIC HEALTH,

00:06:12.858 --> 00:06:15.341
NOT A MATTER OF CONSTITUTIONAL

00:06:15.342 --> 00:06:18.121
LAW, WHAT DO YOU THINK WHEN YOU

00:06:18.155 --> 00:06:20.508
SEE HUNDREDS, THOUSANDS OF

00:06:20.509 --> 00:06:23.320
PEOPLE CLOSE TOGETHER INDOORS

00:06:23.355 --> 00:06:24.371
NOT WEARING MASKS?

00:06:24.406 --> 00:06:27.253
&gt;&gt; Dr. Frieden: THE SCIENCE IS

00:06:27.254 --> 00:06:27.899
CLEAR.

00:06:27.901 --> 00:06:30.112
MORE PEOPLE WITH LESS

00:06:30.113 --> 00:06:33.214
VENTILATION INDOORS WITH A HIGH

00:06:33.215 --> 00:06:35.246
RATE OF CORONAVIRUS, NOT WEARING

00:06:35.248 --> 00:06:39.782
MASKS, THAT IS A FORMULA FOR

00:06:39.783 --> 00:06:43.332
EXPLOSIVE SPREAD OF THE VIRUS.

00:06:43.366 --> 00:06:44.337
&gt;&gt; Chris: FINALLY,

00:06:44.372 --> 00:06:46.218
PRESIDENT TRUMP CONTINUES TO SAY

00:06:46.219 --> 00:06:49.359
THAT WE ARE GOING TO SEE A

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:51.333
VACCINE, HIS WORDS, VERY SOON.

00:06:51.335 --> 00:06:53.527
PERHAPS BY BEFORE THE END OF THE

00:06:53.528 --> 00:06:53.825
YEAR.

00:06:53.826 --> 00:06:55.948
WHAT IS THE LIKELIHOOD OF THAT,

00:06:55.949 --> 00:06:57.459
GIVE US A REALITY CHECK ON ONE

00:06:57.494 --> 00:07:00.739
WE CAN REALLY BEGIN TO THINK

00:07:00.773 --> 00:07:01.783
ABOUT A VACCINE.

00:07:01.784 --> 00:07:02.933
&gt;&gt; Dr. Frieden: ALTHOUGH WE

00:07:02.934 --> 00:07:03.774
ARE SEEING REALLY ENCOURAGING

00:07:03.775 --> 00:07:05.692
PROGRESS, THERE’S NO EVIDENCE

00:07:05.693 --> 00:07:08.230
THAT PEOPLE DO GET IMMUNITY THAT

00:07:08.231 --> 00:07:10.408
MAY BE PROTECTED, THERE ARE MORE

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.636
THAN 100 VACCINE CANDIDATES

00:07:11.637 --> 00:07:12.703
BEING EVALUATED, SOME OF THEM

00:07:12.704 --> 00:07:14.816
ARE LOOKING GOOD AND SOME

00:07:14.817 --> 00:07:15.426
PRELIMINARY STUDIES.

00:07:15.427 --> 00:07:16.769
IT’S REALLY HARD TO DEVELOP A

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:19.469
VACCINE BECAUSE YOU HAVE TO MAKE

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:20.814
SURE IT’S SAFE.

00:07:20.816 --> 00:07:21.958
THERE’S ALREADY TOO MUCH

00:07:21.992 --> 00:07:23.395
SUSPICION ABOUT VACCINES, WE

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:24.758
CAN’T CUT ANY CORNERS.

00:07:24.792 --> 00:07:26.546
WE HAVE TO MAKE SURE IT’S SAFE,

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.674
EFFECTIVE, FIGURE OUT THE RIGHT

00:07:27.709 --> 00:07:30.710
DOSE, DECIDE WHO’S GOING TO GET

00:07:30.744 --> 00:07:31.989
IT FIRST, DEVELOP IT,

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:33.591
MANUFACTURE LARGE QUANTITIES,

00:07:33.592 --> 00:07:36.565
GET IT OUT THERE, SET UP SYSTEMS

00:07:36.567 --> 00:07:38.198
TO TRACK FOR BAD REACTIONS.

00:07:38.231 --> 00:07:40.158
THIS IS NOT A QUICK FIX, IT’S

00:07:40.192 --> 00:07:41.302
REALLY IMPORTANT TO DO -- IT’S

00:07:41.303 --> 00:07:42.706
THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT THING

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:43.903
WE CAN DO TO FIGHT CORONAVIRUS

00:07:43.937 --> 00:07:45.631
AND THAT’S WHY IT’S SO IMPORTANT

00:07:45.632 --> 00:07:47.770
WE HAVE TO IT CAREFULLY.

00:07:47.771 --> 00:07:49.111
WE CAN’T CUT ANY CORNERS.

00:07:49.146 --> 00:07:51.221
WE MAY HAVE AT NEXT YEAR, BUT

00:07:51.222 --> 00:07:52.859
WHAT HAVING IT MEANS IS A LITTLE

00:07:52.893 --> 00:07:54.497
DIFFERENT, IT MEANS THAT PEOPLE

00:07:54.531 --> 00:07:56.110
ARE GOING TO START TO HAVE

00:07:56.144 --> 00:07:57.274
AVAILABILITY FOR HEALTH CARE

00:07:57.276 --> 00:07:58.619
WORKERS, FOR EXAMPLE, BUT WE

00:07:58.653 --> 00:08:01.256
HAVE TO MAKE SURE IT’S SAFE AND

00:08:01.257 --> 00:08:03.754
EFFECTIVE BEFORE WE PUT IT INTO

